  "Description": {
    "Cost": 1029152,
    "UIName": "Revenant",
    "Id": "chassisdef_revenant_UBM-P",
    "Name": "Revenant",
    "Details": "This Revenant that the Blakists were using got somehow hijacked by Pirates. They turned it into a goddamn Security violation, it's basically nothing but an Oil Truck now. It has nothing to do with the original Revenant, they replaced everything with flamers and Oil. 4 Flamer nozzles, 2 in each torso and a fluid Gun in the Cockpit, this thing can Oil and Burn everything around itself. The Engine got a Pirate makeover and to no one's surprise the Distille in the Cockpit got rewired into there. This Thing was leaking on its way in here, I hope no one is going to light a Cigar next to the Mech, otherwise we are going to Explode.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Communications</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.99</color></b>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_revenant"
  },
